   "statement": "**Ask the owner only about how it should look; every technical question is answered here and work continues** — the owner's instruction, 2026-11-24: \"the only thing that should be asked is aesthetic questions... if it has to do with programming or coding in any way... refer to the Manifest to find the solution instead of asking the user\""
